{
  "comment": "Target companies for the 2027-grad APM tracker. ats.type drives scripts/tracker.py; type 'custom' companies are checked by the routine via targeted web search. window_* are historical open-date priors (MM-DD, 2025 cycle) \u2014 priors only, always verify live. ats.feed_coverage (custom-ATS only): feed-proven = the community feed has historically carried this company's PM roles; feed-listed = company appears in the feed but no PM role has come through it; none = no automated coverage, needs a manual check during its window.",
